# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository.
#
# Prettier is configured with `endOfLine: "lf"` and CI runs `format:check` on
# Linux. Without this, a Windows checkout would commit CRLF, and the shell
# scripts in .husky/ and the Docker build would break outright.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binaries.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary

# Keep generated files out of diffs and language statistics.
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated
